  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize getting all 4 marbles out of the Holding Pen early. Start cards are your most valuable resource. Spread your marbles around the board to reduce risk of multiple bumps.\n\nThe Backwards 4 Trick: Use the 4 to move a marble backward into a 'shortcut' position that's only 4-6 spaces from Home Base entry. This converts a long board loop into a quick finish. **Fast Track Risk**: Avoid lingering on Fast Track spaces. Enter only if you can exit immediately.\n\nTeam Coordination (Partnership Play): Sacrifice your own position to bump an opponent threatening your partner's marble. Use split 7s to advance your partner's marbles if rules allow. **Marble Positioning**: Position marbles to block opponents who are ahead. A strategically placed marble forces opponents into 3+ consecutive turns with bad cards.",
    Player: "Prioritize getting all 4 marbles out of the Holding Pen early. Start cards are your most valuable resource. Spread your marbles around the board to reduce risk of multiple bumps.\n\nThe Backwards 4 Trick: Use the 4 to move a marble backward into a 'shortcut' position that's only 4-6 spaces from Home Base entry. This converts a long board loop into a quick finish. **Fast Track Risk**: Avoid lingering on Fast Track spaces. Enter only if you can exit immediately.\n\nTeam Coordination (Partnership Play): Sacrifice your own position to bump an opponent threatening your partner's marble. Use split 7s to advance your partner's marbles if rules allow. **Marble Positioning**: Position marbles to block opponents who are ahead. A strategically placed marble forces opponents into 3+ consecutive turns with bad cards.",
